WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:09.880
What's up everybody!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:10.760
We are Pongfinity

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:14.700
Today we will be finding out how much
more difficult it is playing with our left hands

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.980
instead of our right hands

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.940
Ok, with the right hand

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.060
Around the net and through the tape roll.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.940
I think it went through!

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:34.900
Seven tries?

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:35.700
Or eight

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.320
Not bad

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.160
With the left hand I will get it with nine tries!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:39.300
I don't think so!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:48.780
That was close!

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:50.040
Doesn't count

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.720
Are you making fun of my technique?

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:56.460
Yes, a bit!

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.220
I was sure that was going to be the one!

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:15.740
There!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.860
That's the one!

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:24.300
Look at the balls! You thought it
would be nine tries or something.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:28.020
The next one is a target shot on a cup

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.660
Let's start with the left hand

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.620
It feels like I don't have any control at all

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.720
It also looks like that!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.220
Alright, it's time for the right hand

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.200
I think this should go within 5 shots

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:19.220
That was four!

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.420
Yeah, definitely a lot easier with the strong hand

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:22.420
Target shooting

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:36.120
Let's see how well we can do that with
the left hand

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.020
Let's see if we can get even 2 in a row!

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.740
And don't forget to subscribe

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.960
To help us reach 1 million subscribers!

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.240
That was okay!

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.940
It's not as impressive as our right hand
playing

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:27.860
But it's something!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.760
5 behind the back shots in a row

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:31.840
This should be easy!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.240
But I don't think it will be that easy with the left hand.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.460
You missed the ball!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.380
Try that one!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:05.940
What was I supposed to do?

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:09.640
Alright, this is the one!

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:23.780
17th try.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.360
So we have to go around these cups

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.760
And land it inside this one.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.220
First try!

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.520
Not a bad one.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.020
A bit too short

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.360
So close!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.600
That's the one, I'm pretty sure about it!

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.040
That was maybe 15

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.400
I'm pretty happy about it

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.880
I think the left hand is gonna be very
difficult

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.340
I have never tried this with my left hand

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.540
But I think it is going to be near 100 attempts.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:21.360
Let's see

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:31.020
There is not enough spin

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.600
I almost want to give up right now

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:46.020
30 minutes later

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.300
That's finally the...!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.560
What a shame.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.560
I have to stretch my wrist a bit

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:06.880
It's too painful

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.880
No wonder after 1 hour of trying this!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.240
Yeah, that's the one!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.320
No, it's not enough spin.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.900
This is the one!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.520
It has to go in!

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:22.800
YES!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:27.080
It probably took like 600 tries or something!

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:31.460
It felt like you would really have to learn again all kind of spins and everything

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.400
It's so different with the wrong hand

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.200
And painful!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.340
I think it's safe to say that our right hand trick shots were a bit better than our left.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.920
Dont forget to subscribe to our channel here

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.580
And watch our previous episodes there

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.580
Until next time!

